<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Team Sync</title>
<style>
body{font-family:"Helvetica Neue","Sinhala Sangam MN","Iskoola Pota","Noto Sans Sinhala",sans-serif;max-width:48rem;margin:2rem auto;line-height:1.6;padding:0 1rem}
.meta{margin:0;color:#666;font-size:.85em}.speaker{font-weight:600;color:#222}.translation{color:#555;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 1rem}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Team Sync</h1>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Alice</span> <time datetime="PT0S">00:00:00</time></p>
<p><span lang="en" data-start="0.000">Good morning everyone. Let's start the weekly sync.</span></p>
</section>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Dumindu</span> <time datetime="PT3S">00:00:03</time></p>
<p><span lang="si" data-start="3.500">ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය සූචිය බලමු.</span></p>
</section>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Dumindu</span> <time datetime="PT6S">00:00:06</time></p>
<p><span lang="si" data-start="6.200">මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.</span></p>
</section>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Alice</span> <time datetime="PT9S">00:00:09</time></p>
<p><span lang="en" data-start="9.500">The quarterly numbers look good, but we need to improve the Sinhala transcription accuracy, especially for names.</span></p>
</section>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Dumindu</span> <time datetime="PT14S">00:00:14</time></p>
<p><span lang="en" data-start="14.500">Agreed. I'll review the rules with Zoom &amp; Teams &lt;beta&gt; next week.</span></p>
</section>
<section class="turn">
<p class="meta"><span class="speaker">Alice</span> <time datetime="PT25S">00:00:25</time></p>
<p><span lang="en" data-start="25.000">After a long pause: a quote &quot;hello&quot;, and a comma.</span></p>
</section>
</body>
</html>
